        "title": "ClearNight",
        "subtitle": "Know when the sky is worth it",
        "description": "ClearNight gives you a single clarity score for tonight's sky \u2014 based on cloud cover, moon phase, seeing, and light pollution \u2014 so you always know before you go.\n\nSave your favorite dark-sky spots and get a one-glance verdict for each: GO, borderline, or not tonight. Premium unlocks the full 7-night forecast, unlimited saved spots, hour-by-hour clarity, prime-target timing for what's actually visible, and GO alerts that fire the moment a saved spot's sky clears.\n\nClearNight doesn't guess. It scores.\n\nTerms of Use: https://clearnightapp.com/terms",
